sers and side dishes. It operates grab-and-go sushi outlets and quick dine-in sushi outlets. The company was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Puchong, Malaysia. Empire Premium Food Berhad operates as a subsidiary of Empire 11 Group Sdn Bhd.","zh":"Empire Premium Food Berhad 是一家在马来西亚从事寿司及相关食品饮料零售的公司，成立于2010年，总部位于马来西亚Puchong，是Empire 11 Group Sdn Bhd的子公司。公司以Empire Sushi品牌经营寿司餐饮连锁门店。","lines":["寿司零售：通过Empire Sushi品牌门店销售新鲜寿司及食品饮料产品，面向消费者。","即取即走门店：运营grab-and-go寿司门店，提供便捷外带寿司。","快速堂食门店：运营quick dine-in寿司门店，供顾客店内快速用餐。","餐品供应：提供donburi米饭碗、面食、oden、烤物、开胃菜和配菜等。"],"lines_en":["Sushi retail: sells fresh sushi and related food and beverage products through Empire Sushi branded outlets to consumers.","Grab-and-go outlets: operates grab-and-go sushi outlets for convenient takeaway.","Quick dine-in outlets: operates quick dine-in sushi outlets for fast in-store dining.","Food offerings: offers donburi rice bowls, noodle dishes, oden, grilled items, appetisers and side dishes."]}}